WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:59.370
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:59.640 --> 02:00.120
Chinese.

3
02:01.200 --> 02:01.799
Chinese.

4
02:02.680 --> 02:03.599
What are you looking at?

5
02:03.840 --> 02:04.439
Pick it up.

6
02:05.280 --> 02:05.879
Pick it up!

7
02:07.159 --> 02:07.879
Clean it up.

8
02:49.319 --> 02:51.319
Chinese? Eat up.

9
03:40.759 --> 03:41.159
It looks nice.

10
03:42.759 --> 03:43.159
Not bad.

11
03:49.479 --> 03:50.080
What are you looking at?

12
03:50.759 --> 03:51.960
You can find all this online back home.

13
03:52.639 --> 03:54.680
Besides, we're here on a mission.

14
03:55.520 --> 03:56.879
It's precisely because we're on a mission

15
03:57.039 --> 03:58.719
that I have to get you a gift.

16
04:00.879 --> 04:01.360
This one.

17
04:12.039 --> 04:12.719
How much?

18
04:13.280 --> 04:14.319
800 dollars.

19
04:37.560 --> 04:39.240
What are you doing? There are so many people around!

20
04:39.480 --> 04:40.120
Today...

21
04:40.959 --> 04:42.639
I want to officially propose to you here.

22
04:43.839 --> 04:44.680
You're my girlfriend.

23
04:45.399 --> 04:46.879
We took this trip together...

24
04:47.360 --> 04:48.720
just so I could propose to you.

25
04:52.759 --> 04:53.240
Get up!

26
04:53.240 --> 04:53.920
Come on, get up!

27
04:55.839 --> 04:56.600
Just get up first!

28
04:56.920 --> 04:58.720
Xiaobai, let me truly love you...

29
04:59.639 --> 05:00.519
and cherish you, okay?

30
05:29.720 --> 05:30.160
You

31
05:52.519 --> 05:53.120
Split up and chase them!

32
06:06.879 --> 06:07.759
Who are you?

33
06:08.160 --> 06:09.000
Why are you following us?

34
06:11.360 --> 06:12.240
Following you? What do you mean?

35
06:13.079 --> 06:14.240
I already gave you back your wallet!

36
06:14.560 --> 06:16.519
What more do you want?

37
06:16.839 --> 06:17.879
You've tailed us for blocks.

38
06:18.199 --> 06:19.639
Did you think I wouldn't notice?

39
06:22.040 --> 06:22.720
Fine.

40
06:23.439 --> 06:24.240
I...

41
06:26.079 --> 06:28.920
I was just trying to steal something.

42
06:29.920 --> 06:31.120
I'm sorry.

43
06:36.199 --> 06:37.160
Please let go.

44
06:38.120 --> 06:39.879
Fine, consider yourself lucky.

45
06:41.920 --> 06:42.439
Get lost.

46
06:43.040 --> 06:44.279
Don't let me catch you again.

47
06:44.480 --> 06:45.240
Okay.

48
06:47.879 --> 06:48.639
I'm leaving then.

49
06:48.759 --> 06:49.319
Go.

50
06:51.360 --> 06:52.120
Thanks.

51
06:52.120 --> 06:52.800
Thanks.

52
06:53.160 --> 06:54.319
Thanks, Michael.

53
06:54.920 --> 06:55.360
Wait.

54
06:57.360 --> 06:58.279
What did you call me?

55
07:00.920 --> 07:02.079
Aren't you Michael?

56
07:06.439 --> 07:07.160
You speak Chinese?

57
07:08.040 --> 07:09.360
Who told you my name is Michael?

58
07:09.800 --> 07:10.680
Bro...

59
07:11.199 --> 07:12.800
Just a little.

60
07:13.160 --> 07:14.000
Boss!

61
07:16.199 --> 07:17.399
Boss!

62
07:18.519 --> 07:19.720
Boss!

63
07:22.680 --> 07:24.120
I told you you'd lose.

64
07:24.279 --> 07:24.560
Come on.

65
07:27.319 --> 07:27.680
Where's the money?

66
07:29.199 --> 07:30.639
Money, money, money.

67
07:31.079 --> 07:31.639
I'm done playing.

68
07:32.480 --> 07:33.240
That's all you care about.

69
07:33.240 --> 07:36.480
Just deduct it from my pay.

70
07:36.800 --> 07:37.279
All right?

71
07:41.279 --> 07:41.879
Him?

72
07:42.439 --> 07:43.240
My new partner?

73
07:43.800 --> 07:44.120
Yeah.

74
07:44.839 --> 07:45.560
His name is Tony.

75
07:46.160 --> 07:46.920
He's my informant.

76
07:47.120 --> 07:48.319
Tony, let me introduce you.

77
07:49.000 --> 07:49.879
This is Zhuang Cen.

78
07:50.519 --> 07:51.920
This is Ge Xiaobai.

79
07:52.759 --> 07:53.439
Zhuang Cen.

80
07:54.000 --> 07:55.600
Tony knows Xilano well.

81
07:55.720 --> 07:57.000
He can help you find Ma Jingrong.

82
08:08.480 --> 08:12.040
I'm talking about money. Big money.

83
08:13.439 --> 08:15.800
Serious money. Big money.

84
08:19.360 --> 08:22.439
Don't worry. The guy I recommend is solid.

85
08:23.240 --> 08:25.000
You can count on the person I found.

86
08:30.759 --> 08:33.679
Tony was an undercover cop in Xilano.

87
08:34.240 --> 08:35.799
During a mission,

88
08:35.799 --> 08:36.919
he was forced into drug addiction.

89
08:40.039 --> 08:41.000
After the mission ended,

90
08:42.039 --> 08:42.960
his cravings kicked in,

91
08:43.960 --> 08:46.559
so he bought a large stash from dealers.

92
08:47.200 --> 08:47.879
And as a result,

93
08:48.279 --> 08:49.240
he was sentenced to five years.

94
08:52.399 --> 08:53.440
After his release,

95
08:53.440 --> 08:54.559
the Xilano Police Department

96
08:54.919 --> 08:56.320
dismissed him from the force.

97
08:56.919 --> 08:59.600
But he's a protected Country M informant.

98
09:00.200 --> 09:01.000
Three years ago,

99
09:01.120 --> 09:03.480
he came to assist us at Interpol.

100
09:06.159 --> 09:07.559
How is he doing now?

101
09:16.759 --> 09:17.960
He still hasn't kicked the habit,

102
09:18.320 --> 09:19.879
but Tony is a solid guy.

103
09:20.279 --> 09:20.720
Also,

104
09:21.360 --> 09:22.759
during your mission,

105
09:22.759 --> 09:24.320
never let him get near any drugs.

106
09:32.320 --> 09:33.399
His identity as a cop...

107
09:33.799 --> 09:34.799
How many people know about it?

108
09:39.120 --> 09:40.679
From his very first day on the force,

109
09:40.960 --> 09:41.960
he worked undercover.

110
09:42.159 --> 09:44.399
He never wore a police uniform for a single day.

111
09:45.399 --> 09:46.919
His identity is classified.

112
09:49.799 --> 09:50.120
By the way,

113
09:50.879 --> 09:52.039
I just received word that

114
09:52.440 --> 09:54.240
a repeat offender named Viskay

115
09:54.679 --> 09:56.480
is planning to rob a gang's warehouse.

116
09:56.799 --> 09:59.720
When the time comes, Tony will get you in.

117
10:06.159 --> 10:07.639
Have Zhuang Cen rob drug dealers?

118
10:11.159 --> 10:11.720
Yes.

119
10:12.320 --> 10:13.279
As for this operation,

120
10:13.279 --> 10:14.120
you don't need to worry.

121
10:14.200 --> 10:16.159
I've coordinated with Country M police.

122
10:16.399 --> 10:18.360
Once they make their entry,

123
10:18.480 --> 10:19.559
the Country M police will move in

124
10:19.639 --> 10:20.759
and arrest them immediately.

125
10:20.759 --> 10:22.799
Once they're sent to Xilano Prison,

126
10:22.799 --> 10:25.000
everyone will know about their crimes.

127
10:25.000 --> 10:25.639
That way,

128
10:25.720 --> 10:27.559
no one will ever suspect your cover.

129
10:45.000 --> 10:46.480
The warehouse is heavily guarded at night.

130
10:46.600 --> 10:48.879
It's actually more relaxed during the day.

131
10:48.879 --> 10:50.639
We'll pretend we're picking up goods.

132
10:50.960 --> 10:52.000
Once inside,

133
10:52.000 --> 10:53.480
I'll take everyone hostage.

134
10:53.480 --> 10:54.480
You two grab the cargo.

135
10:55.919 --> 10:56.679
Open up.

136
11:03.320 --> 11:04.039
Hello.

137
11:05.559 --> 11:06.480
Hello, guys.

138
11:08.879 --> 11:09.840
Relax, relax.

139
11:10.919 --> 11:12.519
A new friend to work with.

140
11:15.080 --> 11:16.279
Let him in.

141
11:25.200 --> 11:27.159
This is Michael. A newcomer.

142
11:27.600 --> 11:28.440
Clean record.

143
11:30.320 --> 11:32.960
Took a lot of effort to find him for you.

144
11:33.080 --> 11:35.120
A rookie? Never done a job?

145
11:36.399 --> 11:37.559
Of course.

146
11:38.960 --> 11:40.480
A clean record...

147
11:40.480 --> 11:43.360
...means he's never been caught.

148
11:44.960 --> 11:46.000
He's solid.

149
11:47.600 --> 11:48.759
Do you speak Country M's language?

150
11:49.679 --> 11:52.200
A little. My English is better.

151
11:53.559 --> 11:54.519
Know how to use a gun?

152
12:01.320 --> 12:03.000
Weren't you looking for a driver?

153
12:03.840 --> 12:05.360
We're down a man now.

154
12:05.360 --> 12:06.440
You'll drive when the time comes.

155
12:12.840 --> 12:15.799
I only agreed to introduce someone.

156
12:16.440 --> 12:17.600
I've done time.

157
12:18.200 --> 12:21.480
I wouldn't dare pull this off.

158
12:25.360 --> 12:27.159
What was prison like?

159
12:34.840 --> 12:36.000
Can you handle a gun?

160
12:36.759 --> 12:37.240
Yes.

161
12:41.960 --> 12:43.360
Strip it and reassemble it.

162
12:48.159 --> 12:48.720
Wait.

163
12:49.919 --> 12:50.639
Let's do it together.

164
12:56.360 --> 12:58.559
One, two, three.

165
12:58.720 --> 12:59.360
Go.

166
13:11.759 --> 13:12.440
I won.

167
13:17.480 --> 13:19.360
This is who we need.

168
13:31.320 --> 13:34.480
Zhongtian Company is a state-private mix.

169
13:34.919 --> 13:37.039
Senior cadres are on the state payroll.

170
13:37.200 --> 13:38.519
According to the files,

171
13:38.840 --> 13:40.559
most of them are clean.

172
13:41.159 --> 13:43.519
I think we can start by looking into

173
13:43.519 --> 13:44.879
Zhou Fuhai's assets.

174
13:45.240 --> 13:46.000
If we investigate,

175
13:46.159 --> 13:47.159
we can make a bigger move.

176
13:47.639 --> 13:48.879
Let's see which parts of Zhongtian Company

177
13:49.080 --> 13:51.480
are deliberately covering up

178
13:51.480 --> 13:52.399
Chen Hai's drug trafficking network.

179
13:53.360 --> 13:53.840
Understood.

180
13:55.159 --> 13:55.840
Also,

181
13:56.080 --> 13:58.279
Li Qiang used to work under Chen Hai.

182
13:59.000 --> 14:00.720
I was wondering if

183
14:00.720 --> 14:02.039
he might go to Chen Hai right now.

184
14:02.519 --> 14:03.480
Should we tail him?

185
14:04.200 --> 14:06.039
Li Qiang is desperate to sell and run.

186
14:06.240 --> 14:07.159
Unless forced into a corner,

187
14:07.399 --> 14:09.080
he won't contact Chen Hai at all.

188
14:09.360 --> 14:11.320
All the clues pointing to Chen Hai

189
14:11.519 --> 14:12.879
have only just surfaced.

190
14:13.200 --> 14:14.279
Let's not rush it.

191
14:14.559 --> 14:15.240
Then we'll stand by.

192
14:15.759 --> 14:16.120
Right.

193
14:16.639 --> 14:17.120
Understood.

194
14:19.440 --> 14:21.600
Report any new developments to me immediately.

195
14:21.840 --> 14:22.240
Yes, sir.

196
14:23.519 --> 14:24.080
Lao Huang.

197
14:24.639 --> 14:25.919
Look at how long you've been on the phone.

198
14:26.320 --> 14:28.120
Your noodles are clumped up, and you still haven't eaten.

199
14:28.320 --> 14:29.799
I'm working, aren't I?

200
14:31.360 --> 14:32.399
Work, work, work.

201
14:32.759 --> 14:34.279
That's all you think about all day.

202
14:35.200 --> 14:35.879
Even if you don't rest,

203
14:36.039 --> 14:37.519
your subordinates are getting worn out too.

204
14:38.360 --> 14:39.720
They're passionate about their work.

205
14:39.960 --> 14:40.799
I can't just stop them.

206
14:41.080 --> 14:41.679
Besides,

207
14:41.679 --> 14:42.919
with so many cases right now,

208
14:43.000 --> 14:44.559
how can we get the job done if I don't push?

209
14:44.960 --> 14:46.159
All you care about is the job.

210
14:46.759 --> 14:48.600
You've never given me peace of mind.

211
14:48.799 --> 14:49.840
Day in and day out,

212
14:50.080 --> 14:52.000
how often do I even get to see you?

213
14:52.799 --> 14:54.080
All right, all right.

214
14:55.039 --> 14:56.519
If it weren't for you

215
14:56.519 --> 14:58.480
dedicating yourself fully to our family,

216
14:58.840 --> 15:01.879
how could I focus on my work, right?

217
15:02.440 --> 15:04.200
You're the real hero here.

218
15:04.960 --> 15:06.840
Stop sweet-talking me.

219
15:07.120 --> 15:07.720
Come on.

220
15:08.200 --> 15:09.519
Go eat your noodles.

221
15:12.600 --> 15:13.200
By the way,

222
15:13.960 --> 15:14.720
a few days ago,

223
15:15.600 --> 15:17.320
I ran into Tian Zheng's daughter.

224
15:18.360 --> 15:18.919
Tian Xin.

225
15:21.720 --> 15:23.200
I haven't seen her in years.

226
15:23.320 --> 15:23.840
Oh, and another thing.

227
15:24.960 --> 15:26.320
The two of them are dating.

228
15:27.200 --> 15:27.759
Which two?

229
15:28.240 --> 15:30.200
Tian Xin and our Xiaoxiao.

230
15:30.559 --> 15:31.360
Really?

231
15:34.840 --> 15:36.360
They actually make a good match.

232
15:37.399 --> 15:39.639
You haven't seen Tian Xin in over a decade.

233
15:39.639 --> 15:41.039
How do you know they're a good match?

234
15:41.799 --> 15:42.440
Let me tell you,

235
15:42.799 --> 15:44.840
they seem to have had a little fight lately.

236
15:46.000 --> 15:46.840
What fight?

237
15:49.120 --> 15:51.200
Our Xiaoxiao is being too picky.

238
15:51.440 --> 15:52.559
What are you talking about?

239
15:53.000 --> 15:55.399
He's lucky Tian Xin isn't picky about him.

240
15:56.399 --> 15:57.519
It's the girl

241
15:57.679 --> 15:59.399
who thinks Xiaoxiao's job is too dangerous.

242
15:59.639 --> 16:02.320
Her father died in the line of duty.

243
16:06.799 --> 16:08.840
Why not just have Li Xiao change jobs?

244
16:09.200 --> 16:10.799
With your seniority after all these years,

245
16:10.799 --> 16:11.480
if you pulled a few strings,

246
16:11.480 --> 16:13.240
you could easily find him a good job.

247
16:16.279 --> 16:17.919
You've been with me for so many years,

248
16:18.200 --> 16:19.919
why hasn't your mindset improved at all?

249
16:20.159 --> 16:21.240
If we follow your logic,

250
16:21.399 --> 16:22.559
whenever someone at the bureau dates

251
16:22.600 --> 16:23.840
and their partner demands this,

252
16:24.039 --> 16:25.360
who would still be a cop?

253
16:27.480 --> 16:28.480
Either way, I just don't like

254
16:28.480 --> 16:29.480
our Xiaoxiao working as a cop.

255
16:29.879 --> 16:30.600
Let me tell you,

256
16:30.960 --> 16:32.399
you have to look out for him at work.

257
16:33.039 --> 16:34.159
If anything happens to him

258
16:34.320 --> 16:35.320
under your watch,

259
16:35.639 --> 16:37.320
you couldn't face his parents.

260
16:37.480 --> 16:38.440
What kind of talk is that?

261
16:39.080 --> 16:41.000
So many eyes are watching me at the bureau.

262
16:41.159 --> 16:42.879
Can I openly favor my own nephew?

263
16:44.320 --> 16:46.039
I'm only looking out for your family.

264
16:46.200 --> 16:47.080
Take it or leave it.

265
16:49.600 --> 16:50.919
Alright, alright, stop eating.

266
16:51.000 --> 16:52.679
What are you doing? I haven't eaten yet.

267
16:53.679 --> 16:55.200
A little bickering and you take my food?

268
16:55.360 --> 16:55.879
Look at this.

269
16:56.080 --> 16:57.480
It's congealed. How can you eat that?

270
16:57.480 --> 16:58.440
No worries, no worries.

271
16:59.440 --> 17:00.720
I'll fix you a fresh bowl.

272
17:02.360 --> 17:02.759
By the way,

273
17:03.039 --> 17:04.160
isn't tomorrow Sunday?

274
17:04.759 --> 17:06.720
Tell Li Xiao to bring Tian Xin for dinner.

275
17:07.480 --> 17:08.400
Haven't seen her in years,

276
17:08.960 --> 17:10.240
and I really miss that girl.

277
17:10.240 --> 17:11.559
Alright, got it.

278
17:36.359 --> 17:36.799
Who's this?

279
17:38.000 --> 17:39.079
Boss, it's Guan Qiang.

280
17:39.519 --> 17:39.880
Captain Bai.

281
17:40.279 --> 17:41.119
Regarding the logistics company case,

282
17:41.119 --> 17:42.160
something new has come up.

283
17:42.319 --> 17:42.920
Captain Lu wants to know

284
17:42.920 --> 17:44.519
if you can return for an urgent meeting.

285
17:45.440 --> 17:46.240
I'll be there in 15 minutes.

286
17:46.559 --> 17:46.880
Got it.

287
18:17.319 --> 18:17.960
He Yong.

288
18:19.359 --> 18:20.440
What are you doing here?

289
18:23.279 --> 18:24.839
How many times do I have to tell you?

290
18:25.160 --> 18:27.480
I'm really working overtime for my job.

291
18:27.680 --> 18:28.799
What's this supposed to mean?

292
18:28.920 --> 18:29.599
Checking up on me?

293
18:39.920 --> 18:42.799
Happy birthday, Mom!

294
18:47.920 --> 18:51.319
Happy birthday to you

295
18:51.599 --> 18:55.680
Happy birthday to you

296
18:55.799 --> 19:00.160
Happy birthday to you

297
19:00.160 --> 19:01.599
Happy birthday, Captain Bai!

298
19:01.640 --> 19:04.039
Happy birthday! Happy birthday!

299
19:07.400 --> 19:08.400
Today is your birthday,

300
19:08.720 --> 19:09.440
and our daughter wanted to see you,

301
19:10.200 --> 19:11.279
so I didn't tell you in advance.

302
19:12.000 --> 19:12.720
Happy birthday.

303
19:17.599 --> 19:18.799
What are you guys doing?

304
19:19.599 --> 19:20.599
This is the police department.

305
19:21.079 --> 19:22.480
You're breaking protocol, you know?

306
19:23.279 --> 19:24.000
Captain Bai,

307
19:24.480 --> 19:26.480
if Director Huang comes down on us,

308
19:27.119 --> 19:29.599
Captain Lu said he'd take the blame.

309
19:31.839 --> 19:33.279
I already cleared it with Director Huang.

310
19:33.319 --> 19:33.759
We're fine.

311
19:36.200 --> 19:37.039
Thank you, everyone.

312
19:40.920 --> 19:42.359
Mom, make a wish!

313
19:43.440 --> 19:44.799
Make a wish with Mommy, okay?

314
19:45.000 --> 19:45.559
Okay.

315
19:52.079 --> 19:55.119
Happy birthday to you

316
19:55.240 --> 19:58.519
Happy birthday to you

317
19:58.880 --> 20:02.519
Happy birthday to you

318
20:03.039 --> 20:07.359
Happy birthday to you

319
20:10.160 --> 20:11.960
Let's blow out the candles with Daddy, okay?

320
20:12.079 --> 20:12.720
Okay.

321
20:14.279 --> 20:16.920
One, two, three!

322
20:20.200 --> 20:23.880
Happy birthday!

323
20:26.680 --> 20:27.039
She's asleep.

324
20:33.519 --> 20:34.319
If something's on your mind, say it.

325
20:39.920 --> 20:40.319
Go ahead.

326
20:44.640 --> 20:45.319
Thank you.

327
20:46.559 --> 20:47.759
Geez, you scared me to death!

328
20:49.359 --> 20:50.079
To be honest,

329
20:50.920 --> 20:53.039
conspiring with your team

330
20:53.039 --> 20:54.000
to throw you a birthday party...

331
20:54.400 --> 20:55.480
My heart was pounding the whole time,

332
20:55.720 --> 20:56.519
terrified you'd get angry.

333
20:59.839 --> 21:01.440
Is my image in your mind

334
21:01.680 --> 21:02.599
really that rigid?

335
21:02.839 --> 21:03.480
Not rigid at all.

336
21:04.160 --> 21:06.000
Formidable, and a bit stern.

337
21:08.720 --> 21:10.440
Having such a formidable wife,

338
21:11.279 --> 21:12.160
you must feel pretty wronged, right?

339
21:12.599 --> 21:14.039
Incredibly wronged.

340
21:15.279 --> 21:15.799
Though,

341
21:16.319 --> 21:17.799
wronged, but happy.

342
21:18.559 --> 21:19.640
Let me tell you something.

343
21:21.519 --> 21:23.640
Huanhuan wrote an essay the other day.

344
21:23.839 --> 21:27.079
The teacher had them pick one parent to write about.

345
21:27.359 --> 21:28.640
I thought she'd definitely write about me.

346
21:29.119 --> 21:31.079
Turns out your daughter titled her essay,

347
21:31.319 --> 21:32.519
"My Police Officer Mom."

348
21:33.640 --> 21:35.039
Looks like this dad of hers

349
21:35.319 --> 21:36.640
in our daughter's eyes

350
21:37.559 --> 21:39.720
isn't nearly as heroic as Captain Bai.

351
21:43.480 --> 21:44.640
I'm usually busy with work

352
21:45.279 --> 21:46.319
and have no time for her,

353
21:48.160 --> 21:49.559
but I'm truly grateful to you.

354
21:50.119 --> 21:51.680
Throughout her growing up,

355
21:51.680 --> 21:53.119
you've always been by her side.

356
21:56.880 --> 21:59.319
How come you haven't complained lately

357
21:59.319 --> 22:00.400
about my working overtime?

358
22:03.079 --> 22:04.000
Here's the thing.

359
22:05.160 --> 22:08.799
I've been thinking about this a lot lately.

360
22:11.920 --> 22:14.160
The most foolish thing for me to do

361
22:14.359 --> 22:17.200
is fight against things I can't change.

362
22:18.000 --> 22:20.000
You're busy at work—I can't change that, right?

363
22:21.559 --> 22:23.000
And our bond after all these years—

364
22:23.039 --> 22:23.720
could we ever separate?

365
22:23.920 --> 22:24.319
No way.

366
22:25.519 --> 22:26.640
I can't change that either.

367
22:28.000 --> 22:29.039
So I thought,

368
22:29.680 --> 22:31.880
instead of fighting with you and myself,

369
22:32.279 --> 22:33.599
I might as well go with the flow.

370
22:33.839 --> 22:34.440
Don't you think?

371
22:36.079 --> 22:37.839
Are you sure you're not just compromising?

372
22:40.640 --> 22:41.400
That hurts.

373
22:45.119 --> 22:45.839
Thank you, Commander.

374
22:46.240 --> 22:47.960
We're family. No need to be polite.

375
22:48.240 --> 22:49.119
No formalities between family.

376
22:49.640 --> 22:50.400
No formalities between family.

377
22:50.799 --> 22:51.759
Sleep, sleep, sleep.

378
22:52.200 --> 22:52.880
Time for bed.

379
23:05.480 --> 23:06.039
Um...

380
23:06.039 --> 23:07.880
My car had some trouble this morning,

381
23:07.920 --> 23:10.039
so I called a ride. Is that okay?

382
23:10.039 --> 23:10.559
That's fine.

383
23:11.759 --> 23:12.559
Were you getting impatient?

384
23:14.359 --> 23:16.319
I'd never get impatient waiting for you.

385
23:17.480 --> 23:18.440
Always such a sweet talker.

386
23:23.119 --> 23:23.640
Excuse me, folks.

387
23:23.880 --> 23:24.599
Hurry it up.

388
23:24.599 --> 23:25.599
I have to pick up another passenger.

389
23:27.640 --> 23:28.279
Another passenger?

390
23:28.640 --> 23:29.480
Didn't I book this car?

391
23:29.480 --> 23:30.279
Why pick up anyone else?

392
23:30.559 --> 23:31.119
Look, buddy.

393
23:31.319 --> 23:32.880
You booked a carpool, not a private ride.

394
23:33.119 --> 23:34.039
I booked a carpool?

395
23:34.039 --> 23:34.440
Yeah.

396
23:41.839 --> 23:42.720
I must've tapped the wrong thing.

397
23:43.160 --> 23:44.079
Can I change it?

398
23:44.160 --> 23:45.119
Can't change it now.

399
23:45.119 --> 23:45.920
While I was waiting just now,

400
23:45.920 --> 23:47.000
someone else already joined.

401
23:48.960 --> 23:49.519
Where are we heading first?

402
23:50.559 --> 23:51.880
We pick up someone at Wushankou first,

403
23:52.119 --> 23:53.440
then drop off whoever's closer.

404
23:54.799 --> 23:55.720
Won't this make you late?

405
23:55.920 --> 23:56.680
I'm fine.

406
23:56.880 --> 23:57.960
I booked an appointment online,

407
23:58.079 --> 23:58.839
so I won't have to wait in line.

408
23:59.240 --> 24:00.200
How about I call another car

409
24:00.200 --> 24:00.759
and let him leave?

410
24:00.920 --> 24:02.160
It's fine. Come on, let's go.

411
24:36.359 --> 24:37.279
Did you call for a ride?

412
24:37.480 --> 24:37.839
Yeah.

413
24:38.039 --> 24:40.039
Could you deliver something for me?

414
24:43.680 --> 24:45.240
Is this address correct?

415
24:45.440 --> 24:46.640
The phone number is written on it.

416
24:46.799 --> 24:47.759
Call them when you get there,

417
24:47.960 --> 24:49.000
and someone will come pick it up.

418
24:50.519 --> 24:51.359
All right, sure.

419
25:11.359 --> 25:13.519
How come you're doing delivery gigs too?

420
25:15.119 --> 25:16.200
Just doing people a favor.

421
25:16.279 --> 25:17.400
Plus, it's another fare for me.

422
25:17.960 --> 25:19.119
Besides, when sending stuff these days,

423
25:19.480 --> 25:20.839
people don't even call local couriers.

424
25:21.000 --> 25:23.160
They just hail a ride to deliver it.

425
25:23.839 --> 25:24.799
Whatever they ask you to deliver,

426
25:24.799 --> 25:25.960
you don't even ask what it is?

427
25:26.359 --> 25:27.599
Why would I ask?

428
25:27.599 --> 25:28.640
That's their privacy.

429
25:35.519 --> 25:35.960
Police.

430
25:36.920 --> 25:37.880
I need to check this.

431
25:42.319 --> 25:43.680
I never opened that thing!

432
25:43.680 --> 25:44.960
I have no idea what's inside.

433
25:49.279 --> 25:50.680
It's not state secrets in there, is it?

434
25:53.240 --> 25:54.880
But that kid didn't look like a spy.

435
26:42.559 --> 26:43.119
I'm sorry.

436
26:43.440 --> 26:44.599
Something has come up,

437
26:44.880 --> 26:45.720
so I can't stay with you.

438
26:47.799 --> 26:48.279
It's fine.

439
26:48.640 --> 26:50.160
It's just a routine checkup anyway.

440
26:50.359 --> 26:51.519
I can head back on my own afterward.

441
26:53.400 --> 26:54.640
I thought since it's the weekend,

442
26:54.759 --> 26:55.880
we could spend some more time together.

443
26:56.240 --> 26:56.839
Turns out...

444
26:58.519 --> 26:59.640
It's fine.

445
26:59.640 --> 27:01.440
Am I really that petty?

446
27:11.039 --> 27:12.200
All right, go ahead.

447
27:12.640 --> 27:13.440
Off you go.

448
27:16.799 --> 27:17.640
I'll head inside then.

449
27:17.920 --> 27:18.279
Go ahead.

450
27:22.319 --> 27:23.200
Don't forget about lunch.

451
27:23.839 --> 27:24.960
We're eating at my uncle's place.

452
27:25.440 --> 27:26.519
I'll pick you up when I'm done.

453
27:27.160 --> 27:27.559
No need.

454
27:27.559 --> 27:28.759
I can go myself after the checkup.

455
27:29.039 --> 27:29.759
You don't need to pick me up.

456
27:31.240 --> 27:31.599
Go on.

457
27:37.400 --> 27:38.240
I'd rather watch you leave

458
27:38.240 --> 27:39.039
before I head inside.

459
27:41.960 --> 27:42.279
I'm off.

460
28:33.559 --> 28:34.640
Hey, man...

461
28:34.799 --> 28:36.039
I mean, Officer...

462
28:36.960 --> 28:39.039
I really have nothing to do with this.

463
28:39.319 --> 28:40.839
I was just delivering something on my way.

464
28:42.359 --> 28:44.920
Be careful carrying things for others.

465
28:45.839 --> 28:47.200
Good thing you reminded me.

466
28:47.839 --> 28:49.240
If there was a bomb in there,

467
28:49.240 --> 28:50.599
I'd be a dead man!

468
28:52.799 --> 28:53.599
Once you get there,

469
28:53.599 --> 28:55.119
just hand the stuff directly to him.

470
28:55.119 --> 28:56.359
Don't worry about anything else.

471
28:56.640 --> 28:57.000
And one more thing.

472
28:57.240 --> 28:57.640
In a bit,

473
28:57.640 --> 28:58.799
you need to give me your phone number.

474
28:58.799 --> 28:59.640
In a few days,

475
28:59.799 --> 29:00.240
we might need you

476
29:00.240 --> 29:01.519
to come to the station as a witness.

477
29:02.519 --> 29:03.920
Sure, absolutely.

478
29:10.359 --> 29:11.319
This should be the place.

479
29:12.240 --> 29:12.880
Make the call.

480
29:18.039 --> 29:18.920
Hello? I'm here.

481
29:18.920 --> 29:19.559
Where are you?

482
29:20.960 --> 29:22.759
Could you bring it inside for me?

483
29:23.160 --> 29:24.559
Look, I'm just the driver.

484
29:24.559 --> 29:25.759
I'm not a courier.

485
29:27.039 --> 29:27.680
How about this, then?

486
29:28.039 --> 29:29.400
Wait for me by the entrance.

487
29:29.839 --> 29:30.559
I'll be right out.

488
29:31.039 --> 29:31.799
All right, sure.

489
29:34.559 --> 29:35.400
This is the spot.

490
29:35.640 --> 29:36.559
He's coming out right now.

491
29:40.119 --> 29:40.599
Go deliver it.

492
29:44.559 --> 29:45.839
All right, I'll go.

493
29:58.240 --> 29:59.400
This is yours, right?

494
30:02.799 --> 30:03.400
Thanks.

495
30:03.839 --> 30:04.519
No problem at all.

496
30:23.640 --> 30:24.119
Hello?

497
30:25.599 --> 30:26.000
Who's this?

498
30:28.079 --> 30:28.720
Yeah, got it already.

499
30:30.480 --> 30:31.640
If it's good, I'll get more from you next time.

500
30:33.319 --> 30:33.720
Bye.

501
30:34.480 --> 30:34.759
Alright.

502
30:59.480 --> 30:59.920
Come on.

503
31:39.200 --> 31:39.680
What are you doing?

504
31:43.640 --> 31:44.160
Police.

505
31:44.599 --> 31:45.839
There might be drug suspects inside.

506
31:46.160 --> 31:46.759
Hurry, call the police!

507
31:47.960 --> 31:48.319
Okay.

508
32:31.920 --> 32:33.319
Police! Get down, don't move!

509
32:51.039 --> 32:51.839
I've got a situation here.

510
32:51.839 --> 32:52.400
Send backup right now!

511
33:17.240 --> 33:17.839
What are you doing?

512
33:17.839 --> 33:18.359
What are you doing?

513
33:18.559 --> 33:19.119
Stop!

514
33:30.359 --> 33:30.960
Put him in the car.

515
33:43.359 --> 33:44.319
You're a trained fighter, brother.

516
33:44.720 --> 33:45.440
If it weren't for you,

517
33:45.799 --> 33:47.200
I'd be lying in a hospital bed by now.

518
33:47.440 --> 33:49.319
Protecting public safety is our duty.

519
33:50.480 --> 33:53.279
Am I considered a courageous citizen?

520
33:53.319 --> 33:54.960
Is there some kind of reward for that?

521
33:56.880 --> 33:57.519
Don't worry.

522
33:57.880 --> 33:59.279
I'll definitely report your heroic deed

523
33:59.279 --> 34:00.559
to the relevant authorities.

524
34:01.599 --> 34:01.960
By the way,

525
34:02.400 --> 34:04.039
drug dealers and users nowadays

526
34:04.039 --> 34:05.440
keep finding new ways to commit crimes.

527
34:05.720 --> 34:06.559
In your daily routine,

528
34:06.559 --> 34:07.599
please keep a close watch.

529
34:07.599 --> 34:08.400
If you notice anything suspicious,

530
34:08.559 --> 34:09.760
report it to the police right away.

531
34:10.000 --> 34:11.000
Yes, Officer.

532
34:13.800 --> 34:14.559
We'll be heading out now.

533
34:19.480 --> 34:20.440
Not bad, Officer Li.

534
34:20.880 --> 34:22.199
Cracking a case while taking a ride-share.

535
34:23.840 --> 34:25.360
They were using Psychedelic Blues.

536
34:25.880 --> 34:26.719
We'll have our hands full again.

537
34:29.480 --> 34:29.920
Hold on a second.

538
34:34.239 --> 34:35.199
Uncle?

539
34:35.880 --> 34:36.639
It's your aunt.

540
34:37.239 --> 34:38.559
When are you and Tian Xin getting here?

541
34:38.960 --> 34:39.960
The food's getting cold.

542
34:41.239 --> 34:42.159
Tian Xin isn't there yet?

543
34:43.039 --> 34:44.639
Didn't you say she was coming with you?

544
34:45.039 --> 34:46.559
She told me she was heading over first.

545
34:48.039 --> 34:49.079
Hold on, give me a moment.

546
34:49.079 --> 34:50.119
I'll give her a call.

547
34:53.280 --> 34:54.440
He's worked himself into a daze.

548
34:55.880 --> 34:56.400
That boy...

549
35:19.960 --> 35:21.119
Where are you?

550
35:25.280 --> 35:25.960
Tian Xin.

551
35:28.480 --> 35:29.840
Hey, Li Xiao.

552
35:29.960 --> 35:31.719
Something came up, so I can't make it today.

553
35:32.639 --> 35:33.760
What's wrong? Are you okay?

554
35:34.960 --> 35:37.960
Did something come up in your checkup?

555
35:38.400 --> 35:38.800
No.

556
35:40.920 --> 35:42.840
I really have an emergency. I can't make it.

557
35:43.360 --> 35:44.320
Let's do it another day.

558
36:10.159 --> 36:10.639
Auntie,

559
36:11.880 --> 36:13.119
Tian Xin and I

560
36:14.320 --> 36:15.840
won't be able to make it over today.

561
36:16.400 --> 36:18.039
I'm really sorry.

562
36:18.159 --> 36:20.239
Auntie, could you please let Uncle know?

563
36:21.719 --> 36:22.079
What's wrong?

564
36:26.079 --> 36:27.920
Xiao, if you have something to deal with at home,

565
36:27.960 --> 36:28.880
go ahead.

566
36:29.119 --> 36:29.840
I've got things covered here.

567
36:31.280 --> 36:32.920
We must track down the drug dealers ASAP.

568
36:33.119 --> 36:33.800
Let's hurry.

569
36:36.360 --> 36:36.920
This kid...

570
36:37.440 --> 36:38.599
Why did he cancel on us all of a sudden?

571
36:42.880 --> 36:43.519
What's the matter?

572
36:43.760 --> 36:45.079
Did the young couple have a fight?

573
36:46.679 --> 36:47.719
How should I know?

574
36:48.400 --> 36:49.599
Forget it, let's just eat.

575
36:51.079 --> 36:51.679
Great.

576
36:52.039 --> 36:53.800
This whole table of food will go to waste again.

577
36:55.760 --> 36:57.000
What else can we do?

578
36:57.119 --> 36:58.880
Young people are busy these days.

579
36:59.079 --> 37:00.920
We can't force them to come over.

580
37:06.079 --> 37:06.760
My chest...

581
37:11.039 --> 37:12.440
Why is it that whenever Li Xiao calls,

582
37:13.119 --> 37:14.039
it feels tight?

583
37:14.239 --> 37:16.519
You're just overthinking it.

584
37:19.159 --> 37:20.320
Why do I suddenly feel like

585
37:21.519 --> 37:22.800
something's not right?

586
37:23.360 --> 37:25.760
Why don't you call Li Xiao again

587
37:26.039 --> 37:27.159
and ask what's going on?

588
37:27.239 --> 37:29.039
Nothing's wrong. You're just...

589
37:32.199 --> 37:33.800
Wait here. I'll get your medicine.

590
37:39.559 --> 37:40.559
When we were tailing Liang Wenbiao,

591
37:41.440 --> 37:42.679
this Toyota van

592
37:42.920 --> 37:44.719
was trailing right behind Team A the whole time.

593
37:45.880 --> 37:47.079
If I'm not mistaken,

594
37:47.480 --> 37:49.400
the one who told Liang Wenbiao to abort

595
37:50.079 --> 37:51.400
was probably someone in this van.

596
37:53.039 --> 37:54.679
Could it really be Four-Legged Snake's men?

597
37:56.320 --> 37:57.000
Captain Lu,

598
37:58.599 --> 37:59.559
the drug users from the villa

599
37:59.679 --> 38:00.400
have all been brought back.

600
38:01.519 --> 38:02.440
What about the ride-share driver?

601
38:02.480 --> 38:03.880
For now, there's no indication

602
38:03.880 --> 38:05.440
that he knowingly transported drugs.

603
38:05.880 --> 38:07.719
Once we interrogate them, we'll know for sure.

604
38:08.039 --> 38:09.760
I've contacted the ride-share platform.

605
38:09.920 --> 38:11.559
They're coming to assist our investigation.

606
38:11.760 --> 38:12.679
They should be here soon.

607
38:13.599 --> 38:14.880
You two, look into

608
38:14.880 --> 38:16.199
the drug supplier immediately.

609
38:16.440 --> 38:18.039
If anything looks off, make the arrest.

610
38:18.440 --> 38:19.000
Understood.

611
38:52.960 --> 38:55.119
What... What do you want?

612
39:11.079 --> 39:12.320
Did your cop boyfriend

613
39:12.880 --> 39:15.360
bug Xu Duoduo's place?

614
39:25.360 --> 39:26.199
I don't know!

615
39:26.639 --> 39:27.559
I don't know anything!

616
39:30.320 --> 39:31.880
I lost a brother,

617
39:33.360 --> 39:35.159
and I don't know if my boss is alive or dead.

618
39:35.800 --> 39:37.320
All of this is because of you.

619
39:39.000 --> 39:40.480
So you have to die.

620
39:43.039 --> 39:43.880
I don't know!

621
39:44.480 --> 39:45.719
This has nothing to do with me!

622
39:46.559 --> 39:47.880
I don't know anything!

623
39:48.960 --> 39:49.960
Please, I beg you!

624
39:59.119 --> 39:59.559
I'm sorry.

625
40:02.039 --> 40:03.519
I have to answer to my brother.

626
40:40.519 --> 40:41.239
Keep her alive for now.

627
40:57.639 --> 40:58.559
We looked into

628
40:58.760 --> 41:00.400
the ride-hailing number you provided.

629
41:01.800 --> 41:03.000
It's a temporary virtual number.

630
41:03.360 --> 41:05.199
The owner must have thought

631
41:05.280 --> 41:06.840
this would hide his real identity.

632
41:07.360 --> 41:08.519
But on our back end,

633
41:08.760 --> 41:10.360
it's very easy to trace

634
41:10.360 --> 41:12.159
the number linked to the virtual account.

635
41:12.519 --> 41:14.599
Plus, when using ride-hailing services,

636
41:14.719 --> 41:16.559
real-name verification is mandatory.

637
41:18.280 --> 41:19.480
This is the person you're looking for.

638
41:20.039 --> 41:21.559
His phone and ID numbers are right here.

639
41:23.840 --> 41:24.480
He Bo.

640
41:25.320 --> 41:26.880
Have the info center look into him now.

641
41:27.679 --> 41:28.079
On it.

642
41:29.559 --> 41:30.440
We also checked

643
41:30.440 --> 41:31.440
the user named Xiao Ran.

644
41:32.199 --> 41:33.440
He frequently creates secondary accounts.

645
41:34.159 --> 41:35.159
Through these accounts,

646
41:35.199 --> 41:37.079
he hails rides extremely often.

647
41:37.679 --> 41:39.239
Sometimes he'll use different accounts

648
41:39.320 --> 41:41.400
to hail different rides at the same time.

649
41:42.400 --> 41:42.840
Obviously,

650
41:43.000 --> 41:44.840
his purpose isn't actually to take a ride.

651
41:46.679 --> 41:47.760
Then right now, we also need

652
41:47.760 --> 41:50.480
all destinations this person went to.

653
41:52.400 --> 41:52.920
No problem.

654
41:53.079 --> 41:53.880
Once we pull up the records,

655
41:53.880 --> 41:55.000
we'll fax them to you as soon as possible.

656
41:55.920 --> 41:57.079
Is it possible for these users

657
41:57.079 --> 41:58.000
to use someone else's ID

658
41:58.000 --> 41:59.199
to register an account?

659
41:59.920 --> 42:00.880
If that were the case,

660
42:01.039 --> 42:01.679
then this person

661
42:01.840 --> 42:03.519
must also use someone else's bank account.

662
42:03.639 --> 42:04.800
Because ride fares

663
42:05.000 --> 42:06.679
must go through payment apps

664
42:06.800 --> 42:08.920
to be deducted directly from bank cards.

665
